{"RukuNumber":383,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":33,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَءَايَةٞ لَّهُمُ ٱلۡأَرۡضُ ٱلۡمَيۡتَةُ أَحۡيَيۡنَٰهَا وَأَخۡرَجۡنَا مِنۡهَا حَبّٗا فَمِنۡهُ يَأۡكُلُونَ","TajweedText":"وَءَايَ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ةٌ ل</tajweed>َّهُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَيْتَةُ أَحْيَيْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هَا وَأَخْرَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>نَا مِنْهَا حَب<tajweed class=ikhafa>ًّا ف</tajweed>َمِنْهُ يَأْكُل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٣</span>","End":"٣٣","PageNumber":442,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":34,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَجَعَلۡنَا فِيهَا جَنَّـٰتٖ مِّن نَّخِيلٖ وَأَعۡنَٰبٖ وَفَجَّرۡنَا فِيهَا مِنَ ٱلۡعُيُونِ","TajweedText":"وَجَعَلْنَا فِيهَا جَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>تٍ م</tajweed>ّ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ِن ن</tajweed>َّخِي<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>لٍ و</tajweed>َأَعْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>بٍ و</tajweed>َفَجَّرْنَا فِيهَا مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعُي<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>٣٤</span>","End":"٣٤","PageNumber":442,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":35,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"لِيَأۡكُلُواْ مِن ثَمَرِهِۦ وَمَا عَمِلَتۡهُ أَيۡدِيهِمۡۚ أَفَلَا يَشۡكُرُونَ","TajweedText":"لِيَأْكُلُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ث</tajweed>َمَرِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> وَمَا عَمِلَتْهُ أَيْدِيهِمْ‌ۖ أَفَلَا يَشْكُر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٥</span>","End":"٣٥","PageNumber":442,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":36,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"سُبۡحَٰنَ ٱلَّذِي خَلَقَ ٱلۡأَزۡوَٰجَ كُلَّهَا مِمَّا تُنۢبِتُ ٱلۡأَرۡضُ وَمِنۡ أَنفُسِهِمۡ وَمِمَّا لَا يَعۡلَمُونَ","TajweedText":"سُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>حَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِى خَلَقَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَزْو<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>جَ كُلَّهَا مِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا تُ<tajweed class=iqlab>نۢب</tajweed>ِتُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضُ وَمِنْ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نف</tajweed>ُسِهِمْ وَمِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا لَا يَعْلَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٦</span>","End":"٣٦","PageNumber":442,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":37,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَءَايَةٞ لَّهُمُ ٱلَّيۡلُ نَسۡلَخُ مِنۡهُ ٱلنَّهَارَ فَإِذَا هُم مُّظۡلِمُونَ","TajweedText":"وَءَايَ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ةٌ ل</tajweed>َّهُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّيْلُ نَسْلَخُ مِنْهُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهَارَ فَإِذَا ه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ُّظْلِم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٧</span>","End":"٣٧","PageNumber":442,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":38,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَٱلشَّمۡسُ تَجۡرِي لِمُسۡتَقَرّٖ لَّهَاۚ ذَٰل