ed class=ikhafa>لٌّ ف</tajweed>ِى فَلَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>كٍ ي</tajweed>َسْبَح<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٠</span>","End":"٤٠","PageNumber":442,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":41,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَءَايَةٞ لَّهُمۡ أَنَّا حَمَلۡنَا ذُرِّيَّتَهُمۡ فِي ٱلۡفُلۡكِ ٱلۡمَشۡحُونِ","TajweedText":"وَءَايَ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ةٌ ل</tajweed>َّهُمْ أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا حَمَلْنَا ذُرِّيَّتَهُمْ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْفُلْكِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَشْح<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>٤١</span>","End":"٤١","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":42,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَخَلَقۡنَا لَهُم مِّن مِّثۡلِهِۦ مَا يَرۡكَبُونَ","TajweedText":"وَخَلَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>نَا لَه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ّ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ِن م</tajweed>ِّثْلِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> مَا يَرْكَب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٢</span>","End":"٤٢","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":43,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَإِن نَّشَأۡ نُغۡرِقۡهُمۡ فَلَا صَرِيخَ لَهُمۡ وَلَا هُمۡ يُنقَذُونَ","TajweedText":"وَإ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ِن ن</tajweed>َّشَأْ نُغْرِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>هُمْ فَلَا صَرِيخَ لَهُمْ وَلَا هُمْ يُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نق</tajweed>َذ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٣</span>","End":"٤٣","PageNumber":44