false,"Text":"مَا يَنظُرُونَ إِلَّا صَيۡحَةٗ وَٰحِدَةٗ تَأۡخُذُهُمۡ وَهُمۡ يَخِصِّمُونَ","TajweedText":"مَا يَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نظ</tajweed>ُرُونَ إِلَّا صَيْحَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةً و</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>حِدَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ةً ت</tajweed>َأْخُذُهُمْ وَهُمْ يَخِصِّم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٩</span>","End":"٤٩","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":50,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَلَا يَسۡتَطِيعُونَ تَوۡصِيَةٗ وَلَآ إِلَىٰٓ أَهۡلِهِمۡ يَرۡجِعُونَ","TajweedText":"فَلَا يَسْتَطِيعُونَ تَوْصِيَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةً و</tajweed>َل<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ىٰٓ</tajweed> أَهْلِهِمْ يَرْجِع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٠</span>","End":"٥٠","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false}]}